{"id":"pu_blico","lemma":"público","pos":"noun","rank":738,"glosses":["public","audience"],"ipa":"/ˈpubliko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"públicos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-p%C3%BAblico.wav","examples":[{"text":"No maldigas en público.","en":"Don't swear in public.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453828"},{"text":"Él estaba acusado de despilfarrar fondos públicos.","en":"He was accused of squandering public funds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704386"},{"text":"El público lo sabe.","en":"The public knows that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301856"},{"text":"Después de conferenciar varias horas hicieron públicos los acuerdos.","en":"After conferring for several hours, they made the agreements public."},{"text":"El público parecía aburrido.","en":"The audience looked bored.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735820"}]}